stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> L1
  L1 --> L2: time / failed check
  L2 --> L3: time / failed check
  L3 --> L4: time / failed check
  L4 --> L5: time / failed check
  L3 --> Split: split task
  L4 --> Split
  Split --> L3: children done, merge
  L5 --> Stuck: report stuck to overseer
  Stuck --> L5: keep working
  Stuck --> Stopped: upstream stop or high-confidence oracle stop
  L1 --> Done: check passes
  L2 --> Done
  L3 --> Done
  L4 --> Done
  L5 --> Done
  Done --> [*]
  Stopped --> [*]
